---
if (!import.meta.env.DEV) return Astro.redirect('/404');

const metadata = {
  title: 'Work — Root Branch Learning Studio',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{metadata.title}</title>
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body {
        font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
      nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 1.5rem 3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      }
      nav .logo {
        font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      nav .logo span {
        color: #2563eb;
      }
      nav ul {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      nav ul a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #444;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      }
      nav ul a:hover {
        color: #2563eb;
      }
      .page-header {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
      }
      .eyebrow {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #2563eb;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .page-header h1 {
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
        font-weight: normal;
        color: #111;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .page-header p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.75;
        max-width: 560px;
      }
      .case-studies {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem 2rem 6rem;
      }
      .case-study {
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        padding: 3rem 0;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
        gap: 3rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .case-study {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 1.5rem;
        }
      }
      .cs-meta {
        padding-top: 0.25rem;
      }
      .cs-tag {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #2563eb;
        background: #f0f5ff;
        border: 1px solid #c7d9fb;
        padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }
      .cs-client {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: #999;
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
      }
      .cs-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        color: #111;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      .cs-content p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.75;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .cs-result {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: #111;
        border-left: 3px solid #2563eb;
        padding-left: 1rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .cs-result strong {
        color: #2563eb;
      }
      .coming-soon {
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        padding: 3rem 0;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #aaa;
        font-style: italic;
      }
      .cta-band {
        background: #f8f9fc;
        padding: 4rem 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      }
      .cta-band h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        color: #111;
      }
      .cta-band p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: #666;
        margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      }
      .btn-primary {
        background: #2563eb;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        padding: 2rem 3rem;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #999;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav>
      <a href="/agency" class="logo">Root Branch <span>Learning Studio</span></a>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/agency/services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/agency/case-studies">Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="/agency/work-with-us">Work With Us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Selected Work</p>
      <h1>Case Studies</h1>
      <p>
        A selection of projects across FinTech, SaaS, and technical training. Each project is measured by adoption
        outcomes and behavior change — not course completions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="case-studies">
      <div class="case-study">
        <div class="cs-meta">
          <span class="cs-tag">FinTech</span>
          <p class="cs-client">HR & Compliance Training</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-content">
          <h2>High-Risk Employee Offboarding — Branching Scenario</h2>
          <p>
            HR managers at financial organizations face high-stakes offboarding decisions where wrong choices carry real
            legal and financial consequences. Traditional policy training wasn't changing behavior — managers knew the
            rules but still made the wrong call under pressure.
          </p>
          <p>
            We designed a consequence-driven branching scenario in Articulate Storyline 360 with custom JavaScript
            trigger logic. Wrong decisions produce sourced financial impact screens — real breach cost data tied to each
            specific choice — before the learner can retry. The discomfort is intentional. That's the learning.
          </p>
          <div class="cs-result">
            <strong>Result:</strong> Learners experience the financial consequence of their decision before seeing the correct
            path — producing lasting behavior change rather than policy memorization.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-study">
        <div class="cs-meta">
          <span class="cs-tag">Technical Training</span>
          <p class="cs-client">Developer Curriculum</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-content">
          <h2>AI-Assisted Developer Curriculum — Chegg Skills</h2>
          <p>
            Chegg Skills needed to modernize their Web Development certification program to incorporate AI-assisted
            development workflows — teaching developers not just how to code, but how to work alongside AI tools
            productively.
          </p>
          <p>
            We served as Subject Matter Expert and curriculum designer — creating AI Activity Briefs, Blended AI
            Activities, demo media scripts, storyboards, knowledge checks, and live lessons integrated across Articulate
            Rise 360 and Contentful CMS. The curriculum teaches developers how to become AI-assisted engineers, not just
            prompt writers.
          </p>
          <div class="cs-result">
            <strong>Result:</strong> Full CGG15 Web Development certification curriculum redesigned around AI-native developer
            workflows, deployed at scale across Chegg Skills' enterprise client base.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="coming-soon">Additional case studies coming soon as client engagements are completed.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-band">
      <h2>Want results like these?</h2>
      <p>Tell us about your project and we'll scope it together.</p>
      <a href="/agency/work-with-us" class="btn-primary">Start a Project</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <span>© 2026 Root Branch Learning Studio</span>
      <span>rootbranchlearning.com</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
